  "bio": {
    "zh": "Pugliese 是舞會曲庫裡情緒張力最濃的樂團之一，常安排在夜晚較晚時段。招牌「Yumba」節奏：低音穩定踩拍，和弦部故意錯開往後拖，兩層節奏疊出沉重呼吸感。",
    "en": "Pugliese is among the most intense orquestas in the milonga repertoire, often saved for later in the night. His trademark 'Yumba' stacks a steady bass pulse against delayed chordal accents—two layers that feel like heavy breathing."
  },
  "sound_description": {
    "zh": "Síncopa＋Arrastre（Yumba）、動態忽大忽小、和聲更大膽，偶有不協和堆疊。安靜幾乎消失，然後突然爆發。",
    "en": "Síncopa and arrastre (Yumba), extreme dynamics, bolder harmony with occasional dissonant stacks. Near-silence, then sudden eruption."
  },
